'' -cnoverify skips the layout check: the binding is what the importer wrote, a record
'' whose layout tiko does not reproduce included. For comparing with fbc-modern's
'' -cimport-out, which writes the same text before its own check fails.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -cnoverify -cimport tests/cimport/src/layout.h -cimport-out -
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: type lay_holds_packed4 field = 4
'' EXPECT-OUT: type lay_bits field = 4
'' EXPECT-NOT: tiko lays it out
